+Categories:
+  - Games
+License: Apache-2.0
+AuthorName: Joel Dankert
+SourceCode: https://github.com/JoelDankert/Minesweeper-for-Android
+IssueTracker: https://github.com/JoelDankert/Minesweeper-for-Android/issues
+
+AutoName: Minesweeper
+Summary: Configurable offline Minesweeper for Android
+Description: |-
+    Minesweeper is a native Android implementation of the classic puzzle game with configurable modes and an offline-first design.
+
+    Features include custom board sizes and mine counts, optional no-guess and no-flag modes, saved in-progress games, recent games, score history, adjustable controls, and light and dark themes.
+
+    The app does not require network access and does not include ads, analytics, billing, or account features.
+
+RepoType: git
+Repo: https://github.com/JoelDankert/Minesweeper-for-Android.git
+
+Builds:
+  - versionName: '1.0'
